I’m Developing a Management System and Would Like Some Feedback!
I’m developing a management system for customers, attendants, and technicians. I’m using HTML, Tailwind CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, Express, and MySQL.
Currently, I’m working on the customer registration, listing, editing, and deletion features. The frontend communicates with an API built with Express, which handles requests to the MySQL database.
I’d like to share my code and get some feedback about the project’s structure, organization, functionality, and overall appearance.
